  "findings": [
    "Tangent reduces aggregate recovery RMS about5.06x and trajectory RMS about2.10x; minimum-voltage RMS improvement is about12%. Not uniformly better in every task.",
    "Tangent host mean advance is1.55xfield; no target-cycle inference. Instrumentation overhead/noise is material, so phase timings guide optimization rather than certify speedup.",
    "Both arms miss local3SDbands in selected24hrest cases; case0000after-refresh endpoint error5.8379uV vs localSD1.7524uV. Attribution to a specific approximation requires another control.",
    "Truth substitutions can worsen voltage by breaking compensating state/parameter errors; groups overlap and cannot be interpreted as additive causes.",
    "The worst tangent minimum error0.4801mV on the early weak120mA0.1spulse falls to0.0162mV when true RC/R0 are substituted for scoring only; a localized RC opportunity remains."
  ],
  "recommendation": {
